WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
STEPHANIE WONG:
Today we're talking

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:05.550
about Tau VMs, BigQuery
Security, the future

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.650
of computing and gaming.

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.900
I'm Stephanie Wong, and
welcome to This Week in Cloud,

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.990
where we serve you the
lowest latency news.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.600
Scale out workloads
demand the best combo

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.000
of performance and
price to bring down

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.860
the cost of delivering
applications,

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.860
all while providing an
excellent user experience.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:27.800
We are excited to announce
a new VM family, Tau VMs,

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.230
coming to Google Cloud.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:31.960
Tau VMs extend compute
engines VM offerings

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:35.350
with a new option optimized
for cost-effective performance

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:38.950
of scale out workloads.

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:43.030
We're excited to announce the
GA BigQuery row-level security,

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:45.250
which gives customers
a way to control access

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.520
to subsets of data in the same
table for different groups

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:49.540
of users.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:52.960
Row-Level Security, RLS,
extends the principle

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.050
of least privilege access and
enables fine grained access

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:58.690
control policies
in BigQuery tables.

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:01.030
BigQuery currently
supports access controls

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:06.030
at the project, data set,
table, and column level.

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:09.480
Since quantum computing is the
next technological revolution,

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:12.120
and we want to make it
universally accessible,

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:15.780
we're excited to announce that
quantum computers from IonQ

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:19.290
are now available on the
Google Cloud marketplace.

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:21.810
Developers, researchers,
and enterprises

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:26.340
alike can now access IonQ's
high fidelity 11 qubit

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:29.340
system via Google Cloud
in just a few clicks,

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:32.460
with a billing and provisioning
handled via their existing

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:35.330
Google accounts.

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:38.570
With the surge of new gamers
and an increase in time

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:40.640
spent playing games
in the last year,

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:44.510
it's more important than ever
to delight and engage players.

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:47.030
We're here to help you build
high quality experiences

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:50.060
and take your games
to the next level.

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:53.450
Join us for our online
event on July 12 to the 13th

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:56.510
to catch deep dives full of
best practices to help you

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.780
continue creating great games,
connecting with players,

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:02.257
and scaling your business.

00:02:02.257 --> 00:02:04.340
If you want to read more
about these announcements

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:07.380
or see a full list,
check out the link.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:08.479
Any thoughts or ideas?

00:02:08.479 --> 00:02:10.110
Leave us a comment or tweet us.

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:12.850
We'll see you in the Cloud.

